---
config:
  flowchart:
    curve: linear
---
graph TD
  Start[游戏启动] --> Init[初始化玩家属性<br/>炼气期、初始灵石]
  Init --> Intro[介绍世界观和目标]
  Intro --> MainLoop[主游戏循环]

  MainLoop --> TimeAdvance[时间推进<br/>年/月/日]
  TimeAdvance --> GenerateEvent[生成随机事件]
  GenerateEvent --> UpdatePrices[更新商品价格<br/>根据事件影响]
  UpdatePrices --> ShowStatus[展示当前状态<br/>时间、资产、价格变化]

  ShowStatus --> PlayerDecision{玩家决策}

  PlayerDecision -->|查看市场| ViewMarket[查看商品价格<br/>和历史趋势]
  ViewMarket --> PlayerDecision

  PlayerDecision -->|购买物品| Buy[选择商品和数量<br/>扣除灵石]
  Buy --> PlayerDecision

  PlayerDecision -->|出售物品| Sell[选择库存商品<br/>获得灵石]
  Sell --> PlayerDecision

  PlayerDecision -->|查看新闻| ViewNews[查看近期新闻事件]
  ViewNews --> PlayerDecision

  PlayerDecision -->|查看库存| ViewInventory[查看当前库存]
  ViewInventory --> PlayerDecision

  PlayerDecision -->|查看人脉| ViewRelationships[查看NPC关系]
  ViewRelationships --> PlayerDecision

  PlayerDecision -->|修行提升| Cultivate[消耗资源提升修为]
  Cultivate --> CheckBreakthrough{突破成功?}
  CheckBreakthrough -->|是| RealmUp[境界提升]
  CheckBreakthrough -->|否| RealmStay[境界不变]
  RealmUp --> PlayerDecision
  RealmStay --> PlayerDecision

  PlayerDecision -->|加速时间| SkipTime[跳过一段时间<br/>等待价格变化]
  SkipTime --> MainLoop

  PlayerDecision -->|游历探索| Explore[寻找机会和人脉<br/>有风险]
  Explore --> PlayerDecision

  PlayerDecision -->|结束回合| CheckEndings[检查结局条件]

  CheckEndings --> CheckAscension{飞升条件满足?}
  CheckAscension -->|是| Success[飞升成功结局]
  CheckAscension -->|否| CheckBankruptcy{灵石为负且无法恢复?}
  CheckBankruptcy -->|是| Fail[破产结局]
  CheckBankruptcy -->|否| CheckLifespan{寿元耗尽?}
  CheckLifespan -->|是| Ordinary[平庸结局]
  CheckLifespan -->|否| CheckExit{玩家主动退出?}
  CheckExit -->|是| SaveGame[保存进度退出]
  CheckExit -->|否| MainLoop

  Success --> End[游戏结束]
  Fail --> End
  Ordinary --> End
  SaveGame --> End

  style Start fill:#e1f5ff
  style End fill:#ffe1e1
  style Success fill:#d4edda
  style Fail fill:#f8d7da
  style Ordinary fill:#fff3cd
  style SaveGame fill:#d1ecf1
